# "Each player" (CR 101.4): in a game of three, all of them shuffle hand and graveyard into the library and draw seven. Bot1
# casts Timetwister on turn 1 off Black Lotus; Black Lotus in its graveyard and its remaining hand go back into the library,
# and Bot1 draws seven. Bot2 and Bot3, who have only their opening hands, put them back and draw seven too, so all three hold
# seven cards and the libraries hold the rest; Timetwister alone is in a graveyard, Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Timetwister
Island x5
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Timetwister.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Timetwister
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot3.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot3.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
Bot3.Library.Count = 13
